                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-5704\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: tar\nVersion: 1.35+dfsg-7\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:unstable\nLink: [CVE-2026-5704](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-5704)",
